WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
Listening begins before we decide to study.

00:03.800 --> 00:08.100
A voice, a rhythm, and a useful phrase arrive together.

00:08.100 --> 00:12.600
The transcript keeps the words close without interrupting the story.

00:12.600 --> 00:17.400
When attention drifts, the current line gives us a quiet place to return.

00:17.400 --> 00:21.800
Small moments of recognition become a durable listening habit.

00:22.600 --> 00:26.900
That is enough for today. Keep the next episode within reach.
